    "summary": "Independently qualify a zero-dependency Scientific calendar NuGet candidate from all sixteen unchanged source files and fifteen source-free numerical oracles, without publishing.",
    "value": "Restore/build/pack the original Scientific project in locked offline mode, inspect exact original source/lockfile identities, real nuspec and DLL SHA-256, then run a fresh one-PackageReference binary consumer.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Six Math packages are independently published and qualified in NUGET_LOCAL; Scientific is only an unpublished candidate and must not reuse rehearsal bytes for immutable publication.",
      "Original Scientific source Version 1.1.0-preview.14 and all 16 C# files, csproj and lockfile remain unchanged, with 18 SHA-256 source fingerprints and 541 completed native nodes retained.",
      "Fifteen binary examples span exact/scalar/geometry/signal/series/financial/refusal contracts but do not certify every Scientific API, other OS/RIDs or error guarantees.",
      "No public license, private publication, installed rollback, Discovery/Decision/AURA adoption or another repository modification is authorized."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After successful RS153, qualify the pinned immutable Scientific publisher on a disposable feed; separate owner authorization is required before exact original private publication.",
